# <%= current_page.data.title %>

The Platform Catalogue lists the platform capabilities teams can build on - starting with Terraform modules, with
GitHub Actions, Helm charts and platform services to follow.

Unlike the rest of this site, these pages are **generated, not hand-written**. Each module repo owns a small
`.hmcts/catalogue.yaml` metadata file (see the [catalogue schema](/schemas/terraform-module-catalogue.schema.json)),
and a scheduled GitHub Action scans the `hmcts` organisation for repos tagged with the relevant topic, validates
their metadata, and opens a pull request here with the result. If something in the catalogue is wrong or
out of date, propose a change in that module's repository rather than here - the next refresh will pick it up.

